     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I’ve updated some of the examples and other text. The instructions for starting up fedora are awkward now without the jetty-console build, but there’s not really anything we can do about that unless we make larger changes like using spring boot. I renamed some of the directories to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "my-fcrepo-ocfl-home",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " rather than including a ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "6+",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " in there which isn’t great in filenames.",
