     "body": "<p>I’ve updated some of the examples and other text. The instructions for starting up fedora are awkward now without the jetty-console build, but there’s not really anything we can do about that unless we make larger changes like using spring boot. I renamed some of the directories to <tt>my-fcrepo-ocfl-home</tt> rather than including a <tt>6+</tt> in there which isn’t great in filenames.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/pages/diffpagesbyversion.action?pageId=416973042&amp;selectedPageVersions=3&amp;selectedPageVersions=2\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/pages/diffpagesbyversion.action?pageId=416973042&amp;selectedPageVersions=3&amp;selectedPageVersions=2</a></p>",
     "created": "06/Feb/26 5:20 PM",
